+| Received subject | Current qualified meaning / limit |
+|---|---|
+| organization; | Organize applicable documentary knowledge through responsible definitions and actual assignments, not directory inference. |
+| navigation; | Supply semantic context to Navigation and actual consumers without claiming an installed navigator or mandatory route. |
+| discovery; | Supply meanings to registered Discovery components with actual sources, freshness, checks and observation limits. |
+| governance. | Provide domain usage/change conditions and evidence to responsible Governance decisions without assuming common process or execution. |
